{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19930","headline":"登华岩寺楼望终南山赠林校书兄弟 · 孟郊","name":"登华岩寺楼望终南山赠林校书兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地脊亚爲崖，耸出冥冥中。\n楼根插迥云，殿翼翔危空。\n前山胎元气，灵异生不穷。\n势吞万象高，秀夺五岳雄。\n一望俗虑醒，再登仙愿崇。\n青莲三居士，昼景真赏同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}